se & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Before installing, verify that the QuantCLI package and repository are the ones you intend to trust, prefer a pinned reviewed version or commit, and run it in a virtual environment. Treat generated stock-screening strategies as decision-support material, not financial advice.","findings":"[SQP-3] expected: The single Chinese word in one heading is a minor language-consistency issue and does not change the skill's authority, behavior, or user impact.\n[T08] expected: Installing QuantCLI is purpose-aligned and explicitly disclosed, but the package/source instructions are unpinned and should be run in an isolated environment or pinned to a reviewed version.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789026374032}}}}}